Unicorn (https://github.com/unicorn-engine/unicorn), version 2.1.4
Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2

Linked into libmacadi.so, the emulated Mac that signs in to Find My, which the
APK carries and runs in a process of its own (":macadi"), reached from the rest of
the app over binder. Nothing else in the APK contains it. Unicorn is fetched from
source at build time, pinned by SHA-256 in app/src/main/cpp/macadi/MacAdi.cmake.

The APK carries Unicorn's licence files and a notice saying where the
corresponding source is, under assets/licences/unicorn/. Each release that ships
libmacadi.so has the exact Unicorn source tarball attached beside the APK.

